  contactDamage: 1
  description: A scrap of the dark with two furious eyes. It cannot shoot, cannot
    speak, cannot forgive. It can only arrive.
  tactics: 'CURSED: killing it JAMS your gun for four seconds - it pulses a dark
    aura as warning. It has no weapon; its whole job is to swim between real targets
    and eat your stray bullets. Check your line of fire before you hold the trigger.
    Sometimes the strongest shot is the one you do not take.'
